    <main id="home">
        <section class="hero section-wrap">
            <div class="hero-copy">
                <div class="eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span> A new way to learn is growing in Chattogram</div>
                <h1>Curiosity is<br>their <span class="outline-word">super</span><span class="lime-word">power.</span></h1>
                <p class="hero-lede">Big questions deserve more than textbook answers. We help young minds discover how the world works — by building, testing, and wondering out loud.</p>
                <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-dark" href="https://geniuszoo.com/grade">Find their class <span>↗</span></a><a href="#story" class="text-link">Get to know us <span>↓</span></a></div>
                <div class="hero-proof"><div class="avatar-stack"><span>👩🏽‍🔬</span><span>👨🏽‍🚀</span><span>👧🏽</span><span>🧑🏽‍💻</span></div><div><strong>Made for curious minds</strong><small>Designed with local learners in mind</small></div><div class="proof-divider"></div><div class="proof-stat"><strong>4–16</strong><small>years curious</small></div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-art" aria-label="Young scientist exploring colorful experiments">
                <div class="art-orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="art-orbit orbit-two"></div>
                <div class="art-label label-top"><span>✳</span> WONDER, THEN WONDER MORE</div>
